Project Title:
PocketSmart AI – Your Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

Problem Statement:
Many people find it difficult to manage their daily expenses and make suitable purchasing decisions within their budget.

Idea:
PocketSmart AI is an AI-powered budget and recommendation assistant that helps users plan their expenses, manage their budget, and receive suitable recommendations based on their available budget.

Main Objectives:
1. Help users manage their budget.
2. Track and categorize expenses.
3. Provide AI-based recommendations.
4. Help users make better purchasing decisions.
5. Provide a simple and user-friendly interface.

Target Users:
Students, working professionals, families, and anyone who wants to manage their personal budget.
